WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:04.033
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:05.834
You're here.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.834 --> 00:00:08.300
Thank you very much.
Welcome.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.701
Well, guys,
everyone's talking about this.

00:00:09.701 --> 00:00:11.434
Today, the nominations
were announced

00:00:11.434 --> 00:00:13.767
for the 95th Academy Awards.

00:00:13.767 --> 00:00:16.133
Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:18.501
Leading the way
with 11 nominations is the movie

00:00:18.501 --> 00:00:20.834
"Everything Everywhere
All at Once."

00:00:20.834 --> 00:00:23.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.767 --> 00:00:25.300
It's a film about all the places

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.300
they found President Biden's
classified documents.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:32.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.701 --> 00:00:34.734
Lady Gaga and Rihanna
were nominated

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:38.067
for Best Original Song,
but Taylor Swift was snubbed.

00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:40.167
[ Audience "Oohs" ]

00:00:40.167 --> 00:00:42.200
On the bright side,
the album Taylor writes about

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.567
being snubbed at the Oscars will
probably win all the Grammys.

00:00:44.567 --> 00:00:47.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.534
But this is cool --
Guillermo del Toro's "Pinocchio"

00:00:49.534 --> 00:00:52.534
picked up two nominations.
Yep. Best --

00:00:52.534 --> 00:00:53.601
[ Applause ]

00:00:53.601 --> 00:00:55.167
Best Animated Film

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:57.367
and Best Documentary
About George Santos.

00:00:57.367 --> 00:01:00.400
[ Laughter ]
Yeah.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.400
Some political news --
you're not gonna believe this,

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:05.000
but a dozen classified documents
were just found

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.567
at Mike Pence's house
in Indiana.

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:10.934
The craziest part about these
documents that were found,

00:01:10.934 --> 00:01:13.467
they were found stuffed between
a dozen Wu-Tang albums.

00:01:13.467 --> 00:01:17.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.334 --> 00:01:20.234
When the news broke, Pence was
so embarrassed he turned clear.

00:01:20.234 --> 00:01:23.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.334 --> 00:01:25.367
Apparently, Pence brought
the documents home

00:01:25.367 --> 00:01:27.801
when he blacked out during
a 3:00 a.m. milk binge.

00:01:27.801 --> 00:01:29.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.901
These are crazy times.
Right now, Walgreen's has

00:01:30.901 --> 00:01:33.801
deodorant behind a locked case
while classified documents

00:01:33.801 --> 00:01:38.267
are laying around like J.Crew
catalogues all over the house.

00:01:38.267 --> 00:01:42.033
"This one's from 2015."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.033 --> 00:01:45.000
And get this -- Donald Trump Jr.
posted a video on Facebook

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.367
where he weighed in on all these
classified documents

00:01:47.367 --> 00:01:50.467
being found, and once again,
he used a lot of air quotes.

00:01:50.467 --> 00:01:52.567
[ Laughter ]
Watch this.

00:01:52.567 --> 00:01:56.033
-Just so we understand
the level of hypocrisy

00:01:56.033 --> 00:02:00.534
and ridiculousness -- "a shared
desire to keep quiet.

00:02:00.534 --> 00:02:04.434
Early on, Biden's attorneys
and Justice Department

00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:08.634
investigators both thought
they had a shared understanding

00:02:08.634 --> 00:02:10.934
about keeping the matter quiet.

00:02:10.934 --> 00:02:12.734
But they had
very different reasons."

00:02:12.734 --> 00:02:14.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:17.501
-Even Thing from "Wednesday"
was like, "Calm down, dude."

00:02:17.501 --> 00:02:22.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:25.167
Some business news -- the former
C.E.O. of Dollar General

00:02:25.167 --> 00:02:28.300
is going to be the new C.E.O.
of Dollar Tree.

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:31.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.701 --> 00:02:33.767
I have a feeling he's not even
gonna bother telling his family

00:02:33.767 --> 00:02:34.934
he switched jobs.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.934 --> 00:02:37.901
You know, he's like,
"What's the point?"

00:02:37.901 --> 00:02:39.801
-Dollar General?
-Yeah, it's basically the same.

00:02:39.801 --> 00:02:41.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:43.200
Some more business news --
I heard that mattress maker

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:46.300
Serta Simmons just filed
for bankruptcy.

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:48.334
The head of the company is like,
"It's not about the money,

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:50.567
it's about the memory foam
we made along the way."

00:02:50.567 --> 00:02:53.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.701
Some TV news -- last night
was the season premiere

00:02:55.701 --> 00:02:57.434
